{
  "openapi": "3.0.1",
  "info": {
    "title": "onboarding-orchestrator",
    "description": "Saga de alta F1 en 8 pasos con compensación; queda AWAITING_SIGNATURE hasta que el cliente firma el contrato marco (COMPLETED).\n\nDominio: D-customer · Equipo: Clientes · Oleada: 2 · Puerto: 6305\n\nDepende de: customer-registry, customer-address-service, contact-service, bank-account-verification, allocation-engine, portfolio-service, contract-service, notification-service, iam-service, event-bus, clock-service",
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
